  {
   "id": "scorn-19817@1.2.1.0",
   "gameId": "scorn-19817",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.2.1.0",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-12-06T15:43:21.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's been a pleasure reading your comments and watching your gameplay as you venture through the nightmarish hellscape that is Scorn!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Many of you have made suggestions, we are listening and implementing changes accordingly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have been compiling your comments on some of the issues you have encountered and today we're happy to release patch v 1.2.1.0 (Steam Build: 10089557) focusing primarily on quality-of-life improvements alongside FSR 2.1 support.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can find the detailed list of fixes that the patch brings to the game below:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Bugs",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "NPC respawning after loading the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Scripted animation replaying after loading the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reduced \"Use\" action range on the main door console in ACT I.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mistplane light issue on ACT II.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The main character gets stuck in ACT V.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Selecting the \"Windowed mode\" changes the resolution.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Various issues with the environment.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updates and Additions",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "FSR 2.1 implemented.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "While the world is celebrating the annual Game Awards, you can save 25% off Scorn's launch price. This discount will be available for only a week -- starting December 5!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks again for your support and stay tuned for future updates!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
